      "message": "FICTIONAL PUBLIC DEMO — all people, addresses and events below are invented.\n\nI am Maya Linde. On 1 October 2026 I received a letter from Example Court Housing SA saying that my tenancy at Example Court 11, apartment 2, Bern should end on 31 March 2027. I dispute the termination and would like the evidence reviewed before deciding how to respond.\n\nI rent and occupy this apartment alone. I am unmarried and it is not a shared family home. I report no rent arrears and have not raised an earlier tenancy-rights complaint. I have not requested an extension. Please keep anything that needs independent evidence unresolved.\n\nI have attached my complete tenancy agreement. I do not yet have a digital copy of the termination letter or delivery evidence. No challenge has been filed, no settlement reached and no message sent on my behalf.\n",
